  "title": "Maple Toffee Bars",
  "description": "The maple flavoring in these soft shortbread bars with chocolate topping gives a buttery toffee taste without a lot of work. These have been a family favorite for three generations.",
  "authors": [
    "SFRYMAN"
  ],
